  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Companion artifact for "Trust Is Not a Score: Runtime Assurance Contracts
  for High-Risk AI Agents": case files and decision logs of the deterministic
  failure-injection study in agentic coding (174 distinct mechanisms and an
  independent 124-case corpus written blind by another model), and a
  prospective synthetic holdout (24 episodes, 72 action attempts) comparing a
  Runtime Assurance Contract implementation with a full stateful baseline
  against labels from two blinded LLM judges. All cases are synthetic.
